<title>JAPAN: Japan June refinery rate at 65.7 pct--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan June refinery rate at 65.7 pct--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The utilisation rate of Japan's oil refineries stood at 65.7 percent in June, compared with 62.3 percent the same month a year earlier, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Crude throughput amounted to 16.58 million kl in June, up 5.2 percent from a year earlier but down 9.8 percent from May, MITI said.</p>
<p>Japan's oil companies have a combined refining capacity of 5.3 million barrels-per-stream-day.</p>
</text>
